  "Holds the whole film near one volume. A whispered line and the explosion after it end up much closer together.": "Filimka oo dhan waxay ku haysaa hal heer cod oo u dhow. Hadal la yasheeyay iyo qaraxa ka dambeeya way isu soo dhowaadaan.",
