  "How much of a streamed film is kept on the device around what is playing. More ahead rides out a swarm that slows down; more behind is a rewind that doesn't have to be fetched again. Both are cut down to fit when the device is short of space.": "Inta filim la sii daayo laga hayo qalabka agagaarka meesha la daarayo. Hore oo badan waxay u adkaysataa koox hoos u dhacaysa; gadaal oo badan waa dib u celin aan loo baahnayn in mar kale la soo qaado. Labaduba waa la yareeyaa marka qalabku boos yaraado.",
  "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, channels, television, playlist": "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, kanaallo, telefishan, TV, liiska ciyaarista",
