  "Installed. It takes effect the next time Ventic starts.": "Waa la rakibay. Wuxuu shaqeeyaa marka xigta ee Ventic bilaabmo.",
  "It tells most while moving around with a remote, which is where the fades stack up: on the television this was measured on, that went from 3 frames a second to 23. It starts on there, and off everywhere else.": "Waxaa ugu badan la dareemaa marka lagu socdo remote-ka, halkaas oo isbeddellada isu raacaan: telefishanka lagu cabbiray, wuxuu ka kacay 3 sawir ilbiriqsigiiba ilaa 23. Halkaas wuu shidan yahay bilowga, meelaha kalena wuu damsan yahay.",
  "It was the fall that killed him.\nNot the drop — the sudden stop.": "Waxaa dilay dhicitaanka.\nMa ahayn boodista — joogsiga kedis ah.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.": "Kanaalladiisa waxay ka muuqan doonaan TV Tooska ah. Isku xirka liiska ciyaarista badanaa wuxuu ku jiraa faahfaahinta koontadaada, sidaas darteed waa laga saaraa nuqullada kaydka.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. The password is stored with the address and kept out of backups.": "Kanaalladiisa waxay ka muuqan doonaan TV Tooska ah. Furaha sirta ah waxaa lagu keydiyaa cinwaanka la socda, waana laga saaraa nuqullada kaydka.",
