  "Keep what you have watched in step across every screen you use Ventic on. There is no Ventic account and no server of ours in the middle: the app keeps one small file in storage you already have, and every device reads and writes that same file.": "Ku hay waxa aad daawatay isku mid shaashad kasta oo aad Ventic ku isticmaasho. Ma jiro akoon Ventic mana jiro server annaga leenahay oo dhexda ah: barnaamijku wuxuu hal fayl yar ku hayaa kayd aad hore u lahayd, qalab kastana isla faylkaas ayuu akhriyaa oo qoraa.",
