  "Most servers let you make a password that only works for one app — use one of those here rather than the password to your whole account. It is stored on this device and is the one thing a backup file never carries.": "Serverrada intooda badan waxay kuu ogolaanayaan inaad samaysato furaha oo hal barnaamij oo keliya u shaqeeya — halkan isticmaal mid noocaas ah halkii aad ka isticmaali lahayd furaha akoonkaaga oo dhan. Waxaa lagu kaydiyaa qalabkan waana waxa keliya oo faylka kaydka aanu waligiis siday.",
