  "No peer answered with this release's details, so there is nothing to play yet. Try a different one.": "Asxaab midna kuma soo jawaabin faahfaahinta sii deyntan, sidaas darteed weli waxba lama ciyaari karo. Mid kale isku day.",
  "No playlists yet. Live TV stays empty until you add one — the app comes with no channels and suggests none.": "Weli liisas ciyaarista ma jiraan. TV-ga Tooska ah wuu madhnaan doonaa ilaa aad mid ku darto — barnaamijku kanaal ma wado, midna ma soo jeediyo.",
  "No sound — this device can't decode this release's audio (Dolby or DTS). A release with AAC audio will play.": "Cod ma jiro — qalabkani ma furi karo codka sii deyntan (Dolby ama DTS). Sii deyn leh cod AAC way shaqayn doontaa.",
  "No source answered — {reason}": "Il midna kama jawaabin — {reason}",
  "No sources configured. Add one in Settings → Sources.": "Il lama dejin. Mid ku dar Dejinta → Ilaha.",
  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Weli il ma jirto. Ilaa aad mid ku darto, barnaamijku wuxuu ciyaaraa waxa aad hore u haysatay — wax kasta oo Soo dejinta ku jira, iyo magnet ama fayl torrent oo aad adigu furto.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Qalabkan ma laha dejinta kaydka. Diskka ku habee FAT32 kombuyuutar — sanduuq kasta oo Android wuu aqbalaa.",
  "No subtitles found.": "Qoraal hoose lama helin.",
