  "Not enough has played yet — auto-sync needs about {minutes} minutes of audio to be sure. Nudge the delay for now.": "Weli wax ku filan lama daarin — isku-dubbaridka tooska ah wuxuu u baahan yahay ku dhawaad {minutes} daqiiqo oo cod ah si uu u hubsado. Hadda dib-u-dhaca gacanta ku hagaaji.",
  "Not now": "Hadda maya",
  "Not set": "La ma dejin",
  "Not synced yet. Press Sync now, or wait — Ventic syncs on its own every few minutes and whenever a film ends.": "Weli lama waafajin. Riix Hadda isku waafaji, ama sug — Ventic wuxuu iskiis isu waafajiyaa dhowr daqiiqadood kasta iyo mar kasta oo filim dhammaado.",
  "Nothing answered. On the other device, switch on Settings → Network → “Let other devices play films on this one”, then search again — or type its address below.": "Waxba ma jawaabin. Qalabka kale, shid Dejinta → Shabakadda → “U ogolow qalabka kale inay filimo ku ciyaaraan kan”, ka dibna mar kale raadi — ama hoos ku qor cinwaankiisa.",
  "Nothing arrived from the swarm. This release has no seeders that will talk to this device — try a different one.": "Waxba kama imanin kooxda. Sii deyntan ma leh faafiyayaal la hadli doona qalabkan — mid kale isku day.",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Wax hubaal ah kuma jirin labaatankii daqiiqo ee u dambeeyay — filimka oo dhan waa la dhegeysanayaa…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Weli waxba lama dooran, sidaas darteed asalku hadda waa midab keli ah.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Waxba lama soo dejinayo.",
  "Nothing here.": "Halkan waxba kuma jiraan.",
  "Nothing is arriving on the device this was cast from — its release has no seeders that will talk to it. Pick a different one over there.": "Waxba kama soo gaarayaan qalabka laga gudbiyay — sii deyntiisa ma laha faafiyayaal la hadla. Halkaas mid kale ka dooro.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Waxba kuma habboona.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Waxba qalabkan kuma furi karaan faylkaas. HEVC/x265 iyo AV1 waxay ku tiirsan yihiin furaha qalabka, sanduuqyada duqoobayna midna ma laha — isku day sii deyn 1080p x264.",
  "Nothing to play": "Wax la ciyaaro ma jiro",
  "Off": "Damsan",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Marka damsan yahay, asalkaaga gaarka ah waa laga tagaa: mowduucu wuxuu haystaa midabbadiisa inta sawirku muuqdo, wuuna beddelaa kaliya marka sawirka cinwaan uu daboolo.",
  "On the air": "Baahinta",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Marka shidan yahay, asalku wuxuu raacaa kaarka aad tilmaamayso ama aad dooratay. Marka damsan yahay, wuxuu beddelaa kaliya marka aad dhab ahaan wax furto — waa mid degan liis dheer, halkaas oo dhaqaaqid saf ay haddii kale dib u sawirto daaqadda oo dhan kaar kaar.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Marka shidan yahay, barnaamijku wuxuu ku dul fadhiyaa sawirkaaga, sawirka cinwaankuna wuu daboolaa inta aad ku sugan tahay filim ama taxane. Marka damsan yahay, sawirku wuu meeshiisa joogaa oo waxba marnaba ma daboolaan.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Hal midab, oo shaqo-yaqaanka Material laftiisa ayaa ka soo saara midabaynta inteeda kale.",
