  "Rides the volume for you, so the quiet lines come up and the loud scenes stop making you reach for the remote. This is what every film starts with — the player's own Audio panel changes the film you are watching and nothing else.": "Codka ayuu adiga kuu maamulaa, sidaas darteed hadallada hooseeya way kor u kacaan, muuqaallada cod dheerna kuma qasbaan inaad remote-ka gacanta u geliso. Filim kastaa halkan buu ka bilaabmaa — guddiga Codka ee ciyaaryahanka wuxuu beddelaa oo keliya filimka aad daawanayso.",
  "Right now": "Hadda",
  "Room for {size} of films here. A film that fits is downloaded whole, making space by deleting what was watched longest ago; one that won't fit even then streams instead.": "Halkan waxaa ku jira boos filimo {size} ah. Filimka ku filan si buuxda ayaa loo soo dejiyaa, isagoo boos samaysanaya isagoo tirtiraya waxa ugu horreeyay ee la daawaday; kan aan xitaa markaas ku filnayn waa la sii daayaa beddelkeeda.",
  "Roughly what a 720p frame looks like. Changes reach a running player straight away.": "Qiyaastii sida uu u muuqdo sawirka 720p. Isbeddelladu isla markiiba way gaadhaan ciyaaraha socda.",
