  "Whatever the disk allows": "Inta diskku oggol yahay",
  "Where downloads go": "Meesha soo dejintu tagto",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Meesha filimada iyo qeybaha lagu qoro. Torrent-yada horeba loo soo dejiyay meeshoodii ayay joogaan.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Meesha lagu hayo soo dejinta",
  "Whether a film is downloaded whole and kept, or streamed through a small buffer that is deleted when you stop.": "Haddii filim si buuxda loo soo dejiyo oo la hayo, ama lagu sii daayo kayd yar oo la tirtiro marka aad joojiso.",
  "Which copy to reach for when Ventic picks one for you. It is a preference and not a filter: a tier with nothing worth streaming in it falls through to the next, so asking for 4K on a title that has none still plays the best 1080p.": "Nuqulkee Ventic uu doonto markuu mid kuu doorto. Waa doorbid ee ma aha shaandhayn: heer aan waxba ku jirin oo mudan in la sii daayo wuxuu u dhacaa kan xiga, sidaas darteed inaad 4K weydiisato cinwaan aan lahayn wali waxay ciyaaraysaa 1080p-ga ugu wanaagsan.",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Diskka filimada iyo qeybaha lagu qoro — USB la xiray badanaa wuxuu qaataa wax ka badan sanduuqa laftiisa. Haddii barnaamijka la saaro way baabba'ayaan si kastaba. Torrent-yada horeba loo soo dejiyay meeshoodii ayay joogaan.",
  "While a film is playing. Choose one, then press the key you want it on — Backspace takes it away, Escape leaves it as it was.": "Inta filim uu socdo. Mid dooro, ka dibna riix furaha aad rabto — Backspace wuu ka saaraa, Escape wuxuu uga tagaa sidii uu ahaa.",
  "Windows can't tie torrents to one connection. Most VPN apps have a kill switch of their own that does the same job — turn that on.": "Windows kuma xiri karo torrent-yada hal xiriir. Inta badan app-yada VPN waxay leeyihiin kill switch u gaar ah oo isla shaqadaas qabta — shid.",
  "Without a code, anything on this network can play a film on this screen — fine at home, worth switching back on anywhere else.": "Koodh la'aanteed, wax kasta oo shabakaddan ku jira wuxuu filim ku ciyaari karaa shaashaddan — guriga wuu fiican yahay, meel kale waa u qalantaa in dib loo shido.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Waa mid mudan in la shido meel kasta oo barnaamijku ku culus yahay — gaar ahaan telefishan ama sanduuq TV, halkaas oo shibirka garaafikada uu yahay qayb yar oo kaliya oo kombuyuutar la qaadan karo.",
